<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION SECOND ROUND DRAWS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CLUB COMPETITION SECOND ROUND DRAWS.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draws for the second round of the UEFA Cup and European Cup Winners Cup made on Friday (x-denotes seeded team)</p>
<p>UEFA Cup</p>
<p>(first leg matches Oct 15, second legs Oct 29)</p>
<p>Dynamo Tblisi (Georgia) v x-Boavista (Portugal)</p>
<p>Legia Warsaw (Poland) v x-Besiktas (Turkey)</p>
<p>x-Slavia Prague (Czech Republic) v Valencia (Spain)</p>
<p>SV Hamburg (Germany) v x-Spartak Moscow (Russia)  </p>
<p>Vitoria (Portugal) v x-Anderlecht (Belgium)</p>
<p>x-Roma (Italy) v Karlsruhe (Germany)</p>
<p>Helsingborg (Sweden) v x-Neuchatal Xamax (Switzerland)</p>
<p>Espanyol (Spain) v x-Feyenoord (Netherlands)  </p>
<p>x-Club Brugge (Belgium) v National Bucharest (Romania)</p>
<p>Borussia Moenchengladbach (Germany) v x-Monaco (France)</p>
<p>x-Inter Milan (Italy) v Casino Graz (Austria)</p>
<p>Aberdeen (Scotland) v x-Brondby (Denmark)  </p>
<p>Metz (France) v x-Sporting Lisbon (Portugal)</p>
<p>x-Ferencvaros (Hungary) v Newcastle United (England)</p>
<p>Schalke 04 (Germany) v x-Trabzonspor (Turkey)</p>
<p>x-Lazio (Italy) vs Tenerife (Spain)  </p>
<p>European Cup Winners Cup</p>
<p>(first leg matches Oct 17, second legs Oct 31)</p>
<p>Olympia (Slovenia) v x-AEK Athens (Greece)</p>
<p>x-Barcelona (Spain) v Red Star Belgrade (Yugoslavia)</p>
<p>Galatasaray (Turkey) v x-Paris St Germain (France)</p>
<p>FK Brann v x-PSV Eindhoven (Netherlands)</p>
<p>x-Fiorentina (Italy) v Spartak Moscow (Russia)</p>
<p>Sion (Switzerland) v x-Liverpool (England)</p>
<p>x-Nimes (France) v AIK Solna (Sweden)</p>
<p>x-Benfica (Portugal) v Lokomotiv Moscow (Russia)</p>
<p>In an official alteration made after the completion of the draw, officials decided Karlsruhe will now be at home in the first leg of their UEFA Cup match against Roma.</p>
</text>
